{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/98c4fb203714a402c931ddd027359098.avif?t=1758833007\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0<strong><i>Chop Chop: Together</i></strong>, you and your fellow housemates take on ridiculous jobs to pay rent and keep your dream home alive. Whether you're wrangling fish on a slippery boat, racing forklifts in a hectic warehouse, or cooking for demanding customers in a messy restaurant, chaos is always on the clock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together, yell a lot, and try not to mess it all up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the ultimate <strong>co-op party game for 1\u20134 players, online or on the couch.</strong> With colorful levels, unpredictable hazards, and a ticking timer, teamwork is your only way out. Or\u2026 in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/01ab8c1b3033121e4aa54d5bfbe945ed.avif?t=1758833007\" width=300 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Co-op Professions</strong> \u2013 Fish, cook, deliver, pack, and more through dozens of quirky jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/9137bb36e57f4f1092e3ca8f76eb5e9f.avif?t=1758833007\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Everything</strong> \u2013 Decorate your room, dress up your character, and show off your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/e94d1ec283c77ee54bea0a9f24731c07.avif?t=1758833007\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events &amp; Hazards</strong> \u2013 Slip on seagull poop, get zapped by lightning, or drop fish overboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/2ff0b3d519f9a63177527e2ae5b5e275.avif?t=1758833007\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employee of the Month Mode</strong> \u2013 After each job, compete with friends in bonus mini-challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/2a53143897b15d8c6d86f4d5108bc381.avif?t=1758833007\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Friends, Couples, and Chaos Lovers</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, hard to master, always hilarious.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/4ee687b51ffa12a7c1703a6857c5b339.avif?t=1758833007\" width=300 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're the ultimate multitasker or just along for the ride, <i><strong>Chop Chop: Together</strong></i> will test your friendship, your coordination, and your ability to laugh through the mess.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3065360?t=1758833007","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/2e53a4b471283bcf587e6003d98175df59e4f031/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758833007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/13943d107a4604e984e0f055ced0f06081e2d65a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758833007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/13943d107a4604e984e0f055ced0f06081e2d65a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758833007","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/98c4fb203714a402c931ddd027359098.avif?t=1758833007\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0<strong><i>Chop Chop: Together</i></strong>, you and your fellow housemates take on ridicu